sequenceDiagram
    participant E as lyrion (Emacs)
    participant L as LMS
    participant S as squeezelite

    E->>S: start it<br/>with a name, address and server
    S->>L: connect (SlimProto, 3483)
    Note over L,S: LMS adds the player to its list
    E->>L: find the player and subscribe<br/>to its status (CLI, 9090)
    E->>L: play a release (CLI, 9090)
    L->>S: start streaming (SlimProto, 3483)
    S->>L: request the audio (HTTP, 9000)
    L-->>S: audio
    S->>L: track started (SlimProto, 3483)
    L-->>E: status, 0.3 s after the change (CLI, 9090)
    E->>L: request the cover, if it changed (HTTP, 9000)
    L-->>E: cover image
    Note over E,S: Later tracks: squeezelite fetches the audio ahead, while the last one plays.<br/>The status, and with it the cover, follow when the track starts.
